-- Showcase Level 2 (design sum-type-showcase): structural MAR with a
-- *continuous* inner type. `p(Left ANY)` integrates the Normal over the reals
-- (= 1) and keeps only the branch weight, so it is a dim-0 mass even though a
-- point query on the same arm is a dim-1 density.
main = if Uniform < 0.3 then left Normal else right 0.0
